hpwr3\shpwrk0\shpfblwtxt1\shpz0\shplid1{\sp{\sn shapeType}{\sv 20}}{\sp{\sn lineWidth}{\sv 4445}}}}\pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li3748\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-439\slmult0 \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs44 The Smalltalk-80 System\line \expndtw2 Release Process}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li3726\fi0\ri0\sb223\sa0 \f2\fs20{\b0\i\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs30 Adele Goldberg}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li3737\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex113\expndtw-3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Manager, Software Concepts Group\line \expndtw1 Xerox Palo Alto Research Center\line \expndtw0 Palo Alto, California}\par {\shp {\*\shpinst \shpleft-4\shptop1937\shpright8485\shpbottom1937\shpfhdr0\shpbxcolumn\shpbypara\shpwr3\shpwrk0\shpfblwtxt1\shpz0\shplid1{\sp{\sn shapeType}{\sv 20}}{\sp{\sn lineWidth}{\sv 11430}}}}\pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li0\fi0\ri0\sb2254\sa0\sl-238\slmult0\tx1825 \f2\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex133\expndtw-8\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 'Oduction{\charscalex100\expndtw0\tab }\b0\charscalex113\expndtw3 The Smalltalk-80 system has its roots in the Xerox Palo Alto Research}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li1822\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex113\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Center starting more than \lang1032 10 \lang1033 years ago. During a decade of research,\line \expndtw1 three major systems were designed, implemented, and tested with a va-\line \expndtw0 riety of users. The systems were named for the year in which they were\line \expndtw1 designed. The first two were Smalltalk-72 and Smalltalk-76. The latest\line version, called the Smalltalk-80 system, was developed to be adaptable\line \expndtw2 for implementation on a large number and variety of computers.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li1807\fi238\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex113\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 The Smalltalk research efforts focus on increasing the support that\line \expndtw0 computing systems can provide to users who are not computer scientists\line \expndtw6 by profession. These efforts are centered on the visual impact of\line \expndtw2 bitmapped graphics, on highly interactive user interfaces, and on in-\line creased flexibility in terms of user programmability. Among the out-\line \expndtw0 comes of this work were the basic concepts of windows, menus (textual\line \expndtw1 and iconic), and scroll bars. Implementations of these concepts are used\line \expndtw3 to expand the virtual space of a display screen; they typically empha-\line \expndtw1 size the use of pointing devices rather than keyboards for selecting ob-\line \expndtw-1 jects (documents, devices) and operations on objects (commands).}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li1825\fi234\ri4\sb0\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex113\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 In \lang1032 1979 \lang1033 and \lang1032 1980, \lang1033 requests and clearances were agreed upon within\line \expndtw3 the Xerox Corporation to permit the dissemination of the Smalltalk-80}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li1847\fi0\ri0\sb205\sa0 \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs18 Copyright \loch\af1\hich\af1\dbch\f25\cchs161\lang1032 \'a9\hich\af1\dbch\af25\loch\f1\cchs161  \lang1033 Xerox Corporation \lang1032 1982. \lang1033 All rights reserved.}\par \sect\sectd \sbkpage\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2266\margrsxn1936\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\tlul\tx3956 \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\ul\cf0\charscalex134\expndtw-14\dn0\f25\cchs161\lang1032\fs16 212{\charscalex100\expndtw0\tab }}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb4\sa0 \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex134\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs16 Finding Out About Messages and Methods}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qr\li0\fi0\ri3658\sb752\sa0 \f2\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f2\cchs0\lang1033\fs16 System Browser}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pg