\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-7\dn0\f25\cchs161\lang1032\fs20 0.5%}\cell \pard\intbl\row \trowd\trgaph40 \trrh-245 \clvertalt\cltxlrtb\cellx2887 \clvertalt\cltxlrtb\cellx3751 \clvertalt\cltxlrtb\cellx5047 \clvertalt\clbrdrr\brdrs\brdrw15\cltxlrtb\cellx7473 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \intbl \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 text scanning}\cell \pard \plain \cbpat0\qr\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \intbl \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-10\dn0\f25\cchs161\lang1032\fs20 1,258}\cell \pard \plain \cbpat0\qr\li0\fi0\ri130\sb0\sa0 \intbl \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-7\dn0\f25\cchs161\lang1032\fs20 6.0%}\cell \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li313\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \intbl \f2\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f25\cchs161\lang1032\fs16 0.7%                                  \dbch\af25\loch\af1\hich\f1\cchs161 \u9632\'3f}\cell \pard\intbl\row \trowd\trgaph40 \trrh-331 \clvertalt\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw15\cltxlrtb\cellx2887 \clvertalt\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw15\cltxlrtb\cellx3751 \clvertalt\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw15\cltxlrtb\cellx5047 \clvertalt\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw15\clbrdrr\brdrs\brdrw15\cltxlrtb\cellx7473 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \intbl \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 analysis}\cell \pard \plain \cbpat0\qr\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \intbl \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f25\cchs161\lang1032\fs18 894}\cell \pard \plain \cbpat0\qr\li0\fi0\ri130\sb0\sa0 \intbl \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-7\dn0\f25\cchs161\lang1032\fs20 4.2%}\cell \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li360\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \intbl \f2\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f25\cchs161\lang1032\fs14 --}\cell \pard\intbl\row \pard\sect\sectd \sbkpage\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn1755\margrsxn1248\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li32\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\tlul\tx3830 \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\ul\cf0\charscalex131\expndtw-14\dn0\f25\cchs161\lang1032\fs16 178{\charscalex100\expndtw0\tab }}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li25\fi0\ri0\sb7\sa623 \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex131\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs16 An MC68000-Based Smalltalk-80 System}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn1755\margrsxn1248\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols2\colno1\colw1706\colsr547\colno2\colw6652 {\shp {\*\shpinst \shpleft0\shptop-310\shpright8906\shpbottom-310\shpfhdr0\shpbxmargin\shpbypara\shpwr3\shpwrk0\shpfblwtxt1\shpz0\shplid1{\sp{\sn shapeType}{\sv 20}}{\sp{\sn lineWidth}{\sv 11430}}}}\pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb7\sa0\sl-234\slmult0 \f2\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs28 Virtual\line \expndtw-5 Machine Code\line \expndtw1 Utilization}\par \column \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li7\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 A sampling technique was used to measure the approximate percentage\line \expndtw7 of the total time spent executing each instruction of the virtual ma-\line \expndtw3 chine. The virtual machine program counter was sampled every \lang1032 10 \lang1033 mil-\line \expndtw9 liseconds to construct a histogram of relative utilization for each\line \expndtw5 possible program counter value. It should be noted that this technique\line fails to measure periodic activities which are based on interrupts, such\line \expndtw3 as multiprocessing activity.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li0\fi238\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 The Smalltalk-80 memory image supplied by Xerox Palo Alto Re-\line \expndtw3 search Center contained a set of \lang1032 35 \lang1033 benchmarks, included as methods in\line \expndtw12 class Benchmark. The benchmarks test a number of individual\line \expndtw5 bytecodes, common primitive operations, and several "macro" opera-\line \expndtw4 tions such as compilation and text formatting. The results of running\line Benchmark testStandardTests are reported in Chapter \lang1032 9. \lang1033 The results re-\line \expndtw2 ported in this section were gathered during execution of the Benchmark\line \expndtw4 "macro" operations}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn1755\margrsxn1248\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li2740\fi0\ri0\sb284\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f2\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f2\cchs0\lang1033\fs18 Benchmark new testCompiler\line Benchmark new testDecompiler\line \expndtw1 Benchmark new testlnspect\line \expndtw0 Benchmark new testTextEditing\line \expndtw-1 Benchmark new testTextFormatting}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li2239\fi0\ri18\sb310\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Each of these tests was run five times in a period of just over \lang1032 28 \lang1033 min-\line \expndtw2 utes; \lang1032 170,922 \lang1033 samples were taken, one every \lang1032 10 \lang1033 milliseconds. The time\line \expndtw4 spent in each of the major system components is summarized in Table\line \expndtw1\lang1032 10.2 \lang1033 above and in Fig. \lang1032 10.1.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li2246\fi248\ri4\sb0\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Several sections of the virtual machine deserve special attention. The\line \expndtw4 bytecode fetch and dispatch, which usually requires five instructions,\line \expndtw7 accounts for \lang1032 10.2% \lang1033 of the total execution time. The relatively small\line \expndtw5\lang1032 (1132 \lang1033 bytes, \lang1032 5.4% \lang1033 of total) send/return component of the system ac-\line \expndtw4 counts for \lang1032 39.2% \lang1033 of the execution time. Prior to implementation of a\line \expndtw3 method lookup cache, this percentage was \lang1032 52.5%.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li2236\fi238\ri11\sb0\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 The countDownOthers routine, which recursively decrements the ref-\line erence counts for the fields of deallocated objects, requires \lang1032 11.8% \lang1033 of the\line \expndtw6 execution time. This fact, and the time spent in countDown, suggests\line \expndtw4 that implementation strategies which avoid reference counting of con-\line texts may yield substantial performance improvements.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li2239\fi238\ri22\sb0\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Overall patterns of utilization indicate the value of \i time \i0 optimization\line for send/return and the memory management functions, and \i space \i0 opti-\line \expndtw5 mization for most of the primitive operations, especially the floating-\line \expndtw3 point routines. Fig. \lang1032 10.1 \lang1033 shows the space and time used by each major\line \expndtw1 system component.}\par \sect\sectd \sbkpage\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn1985\margrsxn1687\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols2\colno1\colw2228\colsr2902\colno2\colw3106 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb680\sa0 \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Space Occupied by Code}\par \column \pard \plain \cbpat0\qr\li0\fi0\ri0\sb101\sa0 \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f24\cchs161\lang1032\fs16 179}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-500\slmult0 \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex124\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs18 Virtual Machine Code Utilization\line \charscalex100\expndtw2\fs22 Time Spent in Code}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn9768\margrsxn1421\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f2\fs20\pvpara\phmrg\posnegx-8269\posnegy1098\absw2142\absh-1250\nowrap\dfrmtxtx40\dfrmtxty0 {\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs18 Bytecode \lang1032 & \lang1033 Primitive Tables}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f2\fs20\pvpara\phmrg\posnegx-8269\posnegy1098\absw2142\absh-1250\nowrap