11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn3593\margrsxn778\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 {\shp {\*\shpinst \shpleft7517\shptop9079\shpright7517\shpbottom9770\shpfhdr0\shpbxmargin\shpbypara\shpwr3\shpwrk0\shpfblwtxt1\shpz0\shplid1{\sp{\sn shapeType}{\sv 20}}{\sp{\sn lineWidth}{\sv 8890}}}}{\shp {\*\shpinst \shpleft7553\shptop10066\shpright7553\shpbottom10599\shpfhdr0\shpbxmargin\shpbypara\shpwr3\shpwrk0\shpfblwtxt1\shpz0\shplid1{\sp{\sn shapeType}{\sv 20}}{\sp{\sn lineWidth}{\sv 2540}}}}\pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li1948\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\tlul\tx6419 \f2\fs20{\charscalex100\expndtw0\tab }{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-15\dn0\f25\cchs161\lang1032\fs22 181}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li3384\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex142\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs16 Bytecode and Primitive Frequencies}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li7\fi234\ri871\sb313\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Our implementation was instrumented to tally every bytecode and\line \expndtw5 primitive executed. This instrumentation imposed a time overhead of\line \expndtw2 about \lang1032 22%, \lang1033 low enough to allow execution of reasonably large methods\line \expndtw4 during analysis.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li7\fi238\ri868\sb0\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Bytecode and primitive frequencies are both directly dependent on\line \expndtw3 the methods being executed while data is collected. Two separate meas-\line \expndtw5 urements are reported here. In the first test we ran each of the Bench-\line \expndtw10 mark "macro" operations, listed above. Measurements continued\line \expndtw6 through both the data collection and data reporting phases of the\line \expndtw4 benchmarks. The second test consisted of browsing as rapidly as possi-\line ble for about two minutes; it demonstrates the degree of variation in-\line \expndtw-5 volved.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li11\fi238\ri878\sb0\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw7\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Figure \lang1032 10.2 \lang1033 is a bytecode summary matrix to aid in the interpreta-\line \expndtw3 tion of the bytecode frequency data.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li4\fi234\ri875\sb0\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Table \lang1032 10.3 \lang1033 lists the percentage of total bytecodes executed in each\line \expndtw3 major bytecode category, while executing the "macro" operations. A to-\line \expndtw2 tal of \lang1032 3,750,200 \lang1033 bytecodes were executed while collecting this data.}\par \pard\plain\fs2\sa824\sl-1\slmult0\par\trowd\trgaph40 \trrh-288 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw15\cltxlrtb\cellx972 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw15\cltxlrtb\cellx5630 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw15\clbrdrr\brdrs\brdrw15\cltxlrtb\cellx7538 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \intbl \f2\fs20\cell \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li79\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \intbl \f2\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Table \lang1032 10.3 \lang1033 Bytecode Frequencies by Category in}\cell \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \intbl \f2\fs20\cell \pard\intbl\row \trowd\trgaph40 \trrh-281 \clvertalt\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw15\cltxlrtb\cellx972 \clvertalt\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw15\cltxlrtb\cellx5630 \clvertalt\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw15\clbrdrr\brdrs\brdrw15\cltxlrtb\cellx7538 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \intbl \f2\fs20\cell \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li1040\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \intbl \f2\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Benchmark Macro Tests}\cell \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \intbl \f2\fs20\cell \pard\intbl\row \trowd\trgaph40 \trrh-475 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw15\cltxlrtb\cellx972 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw15\cltxlrtb\cellx5630 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw15\clbrdrr\brdrs\brdrw15\cltxlrtb\cellx7538 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \intbl \f2\fs20{\b