\expndtw5 superclasses). The Smalltalk-80 book recommends reducing the time\line \expndtw3 spent for lookups with a cache. BS incorporates such a method lookup\line cache with \lang1032 1024 \lang1033 entries. The cache slot is computed from the low-order\line \expndtw1\lang1032 10 \lang1033 bits of the result of performing an \i exclusive-or \i0 (the book uses \i and) \i0 of\line \expndtw7 the receiver's class and the selector. Conroy and Pelegri (see Chapter\line \expndtw2\lang1032 13) \lang1033 have conducted a thorough study of Smalltalk-80 method cache be-\line \expndtw8 havior; Table \lang1032 11.15 \lang1033 merely summarizes their findings for BS. The\line \expndtw6 wisdom in the book is borne out, as BS would be \lang1032 40% \lang1033 slower without\line \expndtw2 the cache.}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn1537\margrsxn724\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 {\shp {\*\shpinst \shpleft2268\shptop310\shpright8928\shpbottom310\shpfhdr0\shpbxmargin\shpbypara\shpwr3\shpwrk0\shpfblwtxt1\shpz0\shplid1{\sp{\sn shapeType}{\sv 20}}{\sp{\sn lineWidth}{\sv 4445}}}}{\shp {\*\shpinst \shpleft2261\shptop3362\shpright8914\shpbottom3362\shpfhdr0\shpbxmargin\shpbypara\shpwr3\shpwrk0\shpfblwtxt1\shpz0\shplid1{\sp{\sn shapeType}{\sv 20}}{\sp{\sn lineWidth}{\sv 6985}}}}\pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li4334\fi0\ri0\sb360\sa0 \f2\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Table \lang1032 11.15 \lang1033 Method Caching}\par \pard\plain\fs2\sa281\sl-1\slmult0\par\trowd\trgaph40 \trrh-180 \clvertalt\cltxlrtb\cellx2743 \clvertalt\cltxlrtb\cellx3859 \clvertalt\cltxlrtb\cellx4881 \clvertalt\cltxlrtb\cellx5342 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \intbl \f2\fs20\cell \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li65\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \intbl \f2\fs20{\b0\i\cf0\charscalex108\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs18 Without}\cell \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li216\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \intbl \f2\fs20{\b0\i\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 With}\cell \par