}\par{\pard\plain \sb0\sa0\sl-1\slmult0\fs2\par}\sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn1667\margrsxn1437\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 {\pard\plain \sb187\sa0\sl-1\slmult0\fs2\par}\sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn1667\margrsxn1437\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720 {\shp {\*\shpinst \shpleft5054\shptop-194\shpright5407\shpbottom-194\shpfhdr0\shpbxmargin\shpbypara\shpwr3\shpwrk0\shpfblwtxt1\shpz0\shplid1{\sp{\sn shapeType}{\sv 20}}{\sp{\sn lineWidth}{\sv 6985}}}}{\shp {\*\shpinst \shpleft-29\shptop-50\shpright8978\shpbottom-50\shpfhdr0\shpbxmargin\shpbypara\shpwr3\shpwrk0\shpfblwtxt1\shpz0\shplid1{\sp{\sn shapeType}{\sv 20}}{\sp{\sn lineWidth}{\sv 4445}}}}{\shp {\*\shpinst \shpleft-29\shptop2448\shpright6732\shpbottom2448\shpfhdr0\shpbxmargin\shpbypara\shpwr3\shpwrk0\shpfblwtxt1\shpz0\shplid1{\sp{\sn shapeType}{\sv 20}}{\sp{\sn lineWidth}{\sv 6985}}}}{\pard\plain \sb0\sa0\sl-1\slmult0\fs2\par}\pard \plain \li0\ri0\sb0\sa0\pvpara\phmrg\posnegx0\posnegy0\absw0\absh2404\nowrap\dfrmtxtx10080\dfrmtxty0 {\pict\picw11049\pich4241\picwgoal6264\pichgoal2404\jpegblip
}\par{\pard\plain \sb0\sa0\sl-1\slmult0\fs2\par}\sect\sectd \sbkpage\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn1572\margrsxn1395\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 {\shp {\*\shpinst \shpleft4183\shptop-299\shpright8762\shpbottom-299\shpfhdr0\shpbxmargin\shpbypara\shpwr3\shpwrk0\shpfblwtxt1\shpz0\shplid1{\sp{\sn shapeType}{\sv 20}}{\sp{\sn lineWidth}{\sv 6985}}}}\pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li4176\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-432\slmult0 \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs44 The Analysis of the\line \expndtw3 Smalltalk-80 System at\line \expndtw-2 Hewlett-Packard \lang1032 *}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li4172\fi0\ri0\sb191\sa0 \f2\fs20{\b0\i\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs30 Joseph R. Falcone}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li4176\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa1670\sl-238\slmult0 \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Computer Research Center\line \expndtw3 Hewlett-Packard Laboratories\line \expndtw2 Palo Alto, California}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn1572\margrsxn1413\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols2\colno1\colw1526\colsr727\colno2\colw6670 {\shp {\*\shpinst \shpleft0\shptop-252\shpright8906\shpbottom-252\shpfhdr0\shpbxmargin\shpbypara\shpwr3\shpwrk0\shpfblwtxt1\shpz0\shplid1{\sp{\sn shapeType}{\sv 20}}{\sp{\sn lineWidth}{\sv 11430}}}}\pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f2\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs28 Introduction}\par \column \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li0\fi0\ri0\sb65\sa0\sl-234\slmult0 \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 The implementation of Smalltalk at Hewlett-Packard Laboratories was\line \expndtw3 the principal component of an investigation into personal computing\line environments. As we developed the implementation, we continually an-\line \expndtw4 alyzed its performance \i to \i0 achieve a better understanding of the system.\line This program began in earnest in March of \lang1032 1981 \lang1033 when we embarked on\line the first implementation. By November, the entire project was winding\line \expndtw5 down and we placed more emphasis on performance analysis to com-\line \expndtw3 plete it before the end. When the project closed in February of \lang1032 1982, \lang1033 we\line \expndtw2 had developed a vast body of performance data, collected by both pro-\line \expndtw4 grams and people. Since then only the performance analysis has contin-\line ued (as an unofficial part-time activity). The HP Smalltalk project is\line described in more detail in Chapter \lang1032 6.}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn1597\margrsxn1395\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 {\pard\plain \sb914\sa0\sl-1\slmult0\fs2\par}\sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn1597\margrsxn1395\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols2\colno1\colw1202\colsr1051\colno2\colw6663 {\shp {\*\shpinst \shpleft-4\shptop-245\shpright8917\shpbottom-245\shpfhdr0\shpbxmargin\shpbypara\shpwr3\shpwrk0\shpfblwtxt1\shpz0\shplid1{\sp{\sn shapeType}{\sv 20}}{\sp{\sn lineWidth}{\sv 11430}}}}\pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f2\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs28 Approach}\par \column \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li14\fi0\ri0\sb61\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 The Smalltalk-80 system is difficult to measure, given the variability of\line \expndtw5 user interaction which is fundamental to it. Repeating the identical test\line \expndtw8 twice was nearly impossible so we designated a general collection of}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li0\fi0\ri18\sb277\sa0\sl-198\slmult0 \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs18 The views expressed herein are those of the author, and do not necessarily represent the\line \expndtw3 position of Hewlett-Packard or any commitment to products or services. Copyright \loch\af1\hich\af1\dbch\f25\cchs161\lang1032 \'a9\line \expndtw1\hich\af1\dbch\af3\loch\f1\cchs0\lang1033 Joseph R. Falcone, \lang1032 1982. \lang1033 All rights reserved.}\par \sect\sectd \sbkpage\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn1525\margrsxn1449\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li79\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\tlul\tx5724 \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\ul\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-6\dn0\f25\cchs161\lang1032\fs20 208{\charscalex100\expndtw0\tab }}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li76\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw12\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 The Analysis of the Smalltalk-80 System at Hewlett-Packard}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li2272\fi0\ri4\sb288\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 tasks as the \i basic test, \i0 touching all of the capabilities of the system at\line \expndtw3 least once according to our view of personal computer usage patterns.\line During this test, the browser, compiler, decompiler, and window system\line are exercised in every conceivable way. With full performance monitor-\line \expndtw4 ing, the test covers millions of bytecodes and takes over six hours. Our\line \expndtw7 test should not be confused with the testStandardTests benchmarks.\line \expndtw4 Early investigative work on our system used the testStandardTests\line \expndtw6 benchmarks until we noticed that the results bore little relation to sta-\line \expndtw4 tistics gathered from normal usage. Hence we felt that it was not useful\line as a personal computing performance test.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li2272\fi241\ri0\sb0\sa1372\sl-238\slmult0 \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 In the following sections, we present measurements of the system\line \expndtw2 compiled from many \i basic test \i0 experiments. The measurements cover a\line \expndtw1 wide variety of system functions, from bytecode frequencies to memory\line \expndtw3 access. These figures are probably accurate to within \lang1032 10% \lang1033 for different\line \expndtw2 mixes of Smalltalk-80 code. We conducted these tests on a pre-release\line \expndtw3 version of the Smalltalk-80 system.}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn1525\margrsxn2025\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols2\colno1\colw1738\colsr1087\colno2\colw5533 {\shp {\*\shpinst \shpleft-11\shptop-317\shpright8924\shpbottom-317\shpfhdr0\shpbxmargin\shpbypara\shpwr3\shpwrk0\shpfblwtxt1\shpz0\shplid1{\sp{\sn shapeType}{\sv 20}}{\sp{\sn lineWidth}{\sv 8890}}}}\pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f2\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs28 Bytecode\line \expndtw-4 Measurements}\par \column \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb212\sa0 \f2\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Table \lang1032 12.1 \lang1033 Smalltalk-80 Virtual Machine Bytecode Frequency}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn3775\margrsxn1579\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 {\pard\plain \sb191\sa0\sl-1\slmult0\fs2\par}\sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn3775\margrsxn1579\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols2\colno1\colw2541\colsr806\colno2\colw3207 {\shp {\*\shpinst \shpleft14\shptop-187\shpright6667\shpbottom-187\shpfhdr0\shpbxmargin\shpbypara\shpwr3\shpwrk0\shpfblwtxt1\shpz0\shplid1{\sp{\sn shapeType}{\sv 20}}{\sp{\sn lineWidth}{\sv 6985}}}}{\pard\plain \sb0\sa0\sl-1\slmult0\fs2\par}\pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f2\fs20\pvpara\phmrg\posnegx3136\posnegy0\absw0\absh-231\dfrmtxtx40\dfrmtxty0 {\b0\i\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Static \lang1032 %}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li515\fi0\ri0\sb4\sa0 \f2\fs20{\b0\i\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 SVM Bytecode}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li14\fi0\ri0\sb119\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 push temporary variable \lang1032 0}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li14\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lan