cation and division account for only about \lang1032 3.5% \lang1033 of special\line \expndtw5 arithmetic sends. The static and dynamic frequencies show interesting\line \expndtw7 differences. The execution frequency of \lang1032 < = \lang1033 is four times the static,\line \expndtw4 while the opposite is true for @ and \lang1032 = \lang1033 where the static frequencies are\line \expndtw5 twice the dynamic. The multiplication bytecode is fifth in static fre-\line quency with a rate eight times its execution percentage.}\par {\shp {\*\shpinst \shpleft0\shptop688\shpright6653\shpbottom688\shpfhdr0\shpbxcolumn\shpbypara\shpwr3\shpwrk0\shpfblwtxt1\shpz0\shplid1{\sp{\sn shapeType}{\sv 20}}{\sp{\sn lineWidth}{\sv 6985}}}}\pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li1206\fi0\ri0\sb738\sa119 \f2\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Table \lang1032 12.10 \lang1033 Common Send Bytecode Frequency}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn3661\margrsxn1962\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols2\colno1\colw936\colsr1973\colno2\colw3376 {\shp {\*\shpinst \shpleft0\shptop-83\shpright6653\shpbottom-83\shpfhdr0\shpbxmargin\shpbypara\shpwr3\shpwrk0\shpfblwtxt1\shpz0\shplid1{\sp{\sn shapeType}{\sv 20}}{\sp{\sn lineWidth}{\sv 6985}}}}\pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li7\fi119\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-364\slmult0 \f2\fs20{\b0\i\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Bytecode\line \i0\expndtw-2 at:}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb500\sa0 \f2\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f2\cchs0\lang1033\fs18 y}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li4\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 value:*}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li4\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 size}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li4\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-9\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 blockCopy\lang1032 :"}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0