rgin\shpbypara\shpwr3\shpwrk0\shpfblwtxt1\shpz0\shplid1{\sp{\sn shapeType}{\sv 20}}{\sp{\sn lineWidth}{\sv 4445}}}}\pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li2232\fi0\ri4\sb317\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Table \lang1032 12.12 \lang1033 gives the number of links traversed to look up messages in\line \expndtw2 the dictionaries of superclasses. The zero category corresponds to mes-\line \expndtw7 sages understood by the class of their receiver and therefore no links\line are traversed. The average traversal distance is \lang1032 1.18, \lang1033 but the majority\line \expndtw2 of messages never go to the superclass. Nearly \lang1032 14% \lang1033 search four or more\line \expndtw5 dictionaries, thus skewing the figures in that direction.}\par \sect\sectd \sbkpage\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn1568\margrsxn1425\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 {\shp {\*\shpinst \shpleft2272\shptop-79\shpright8896\shpbottom-79\shpfhdr0\shpbxmargin\shpbypara\shpwr3\shpwrk0\shpfblwtxt1\shpz0\shplid1{\sp{\sn shapeType}{\sv 20}}{\sp{\sn lineWidth}{\sv 4445}}}}\pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li3305\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa194 \f2\fs20{\b\i0\ul\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Table \lang1032 12.13 \lang1033 Message Dictionary Pro\ul0 bes by Number}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn3825\margrsxn1828\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols2\colno1\colw1461\colsr1789\colno2\colw3006 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \f2\fs20{\b0\i\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Number of Probes}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li227\fi0\ri0\sb119\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f25\cchs161\lang1032\fs20 1 \lang1033 (direct hit)}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li216\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f25\cchs161\lang1032\fs20 2}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li216\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f25\