(11.76% \lang1033 vs. \lang1032 1.82%). \lang1033 This indicates\line \expndtw8 that methods manipulate temporary variables more than arguments,\line \expndtw3 since temporary slot \lang1032 0 \lang1033 is usually occupied by the first message parame-\line ter.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li11\fi0\ri0\sb140\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 The system spends nearly one-sixth of execution on these transfer of\line \expndtw3 control instructions. The return bytecodes are the most sophisticated of\line \expndtw4 them, having to reset the sender as the active context upon leaving a\line \expndtw3 method. The special case sends have diminished the importance of re-\line \expndtw4 turns by relegating their use to the relatively small percentage of meth-\line \expndtw5 od sends. We divide the other control transfer bytecodes into \i branches\line \i0\expndtw4 for the single-byte short versions and \i jumps \i0 for the multiple-byte long\line \expndtw6 ones. These are not very significant either because the tiny size of\line \expndtw3 Smalltalk methods leaves precious little space for much transfer of con-\line \expndtw0 trol.}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn1436\margrsxn1549\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard\plain\fs2\sa184\sl-1\slmult0\par\trowd\trgaph40 \trrh-331 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw15\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw15\cltxlrtb\cellx2102 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw15\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw15\cltxlrtb\cellx4168 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw15\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw15\cltxlrtb\cellx5457 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw15\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw15\cltxlrtb\cellx6659 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li1444\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \intbl \f2\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Table}\cell \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \intbl \f2\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f25\cchs161\lang1032\fs20 12.19 \lang1033 Return Bytecode}\cell \pard \plain \cbpat0\qr\li0\fi0\ri18