rward jump has a greater static frequency by\line \expndtw5 nearly four to one. The branches and jumps in the \i others \i0 category have\line \expndtw6 a low execution frequency but appear statically more than three times\line \expndtw2 as often.}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn1503\margrsxn1489\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols2\colno1\colw1746\colsr522\colno2\colw6649 {\shp {\*\shpinst \shpleft-4\shptop-317\shpright8924\shpbottom-317\shpfhdr0\shpbxmargin\shpbypara\shpwr3\shpwrk0\shpfblwtxt1\shpz0\shplid1{\sp{\sn shapeType}{\sv 20}}{\sp{\sn lineWidth}{\sv 11430}}}}\pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li4\fi0\ri0\sb11\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f2\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs28 Memory}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li7\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f2\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs28 System}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f2\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs28 Measurements}\par \column \pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 The performance of the object memory system is vital to a Smalltalk-80\line implementation. We recognized this early, and we were able to improve\line \expndtw4 memory system performance substantially through regular analyses of\line profile data. The following tables are the culmination of this effort.}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn1506\margrsxn805\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 {\pard\plain \sb396\sa0\sl-1\slmult0\fs2\par}\sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn1506\margrsxn805\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols3\colno1\colw1263\colsr1001\colno2\colw1396\colsr1904\colno3\colw4032 {\shp {\*\shpinst \shpleft2254\shptop-115\shpright8907\shpbottom-115\shpfhdr0\shpbxmargin\shpbypara\shpwr3\shpwrk0\shpfblwtxt1\shpz0\shplid1{\sp{\sn shapeType}{\sv 20}}{\sp{\sn lineWidth}{\sv 4445}}}}{\shp 