\intbl \f2\fs20\pvpara\phcol\posnegx3434\posnegy112\absw0\absh1094\dfrmtxtx40\dfrmtxty0 {\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-8\dn0\f25\cchs161\lang1032\fs20 100.00%}\cell \pard\intbl\row \pard\pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li292\fi0\ri0\sb119\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-3\dn0\f25\cchs161\lang1032\fs20 18 \lang1033 words\line \expndtw-2\lang1032 2 \lang1033 words\line \lang1032 38 \lang1033 words\line \expndtw-3\lang1032 1 \lang1033 word\line \expndtw0 all others \lang1032 (98)}\par {\shp {\*\shpinst \shpleft-7\shptop47\shpright6653\shpbottom47\shpfhdr0\shpbxcolumn\shpbypara\shpwr3\shpwrk0\shpfblwtxt1\shpz0\shplid1{\sp{\sn shapeType}{\sv 20}}{\sp{\sn lineWidth}{\sv 4445}}}}\pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li4\fi0\ri14\sb504\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Instantiations are listed by object field size in Table \lang1032 12.33. \lang1033 The three\line \expndtw2 most popular sizes exceed \lang1032 97% \lang1033 of all instantiations, suggesting a corre-\line \expndtw8 lation with the preceding type figures. These sizes are those chiefly\line \expndtw3 used for small contexts, points, and large contexts, respectively.}\par {\shp {\*\shpinst \shpleft22\shptop544\shpright6675\shpbottom544\shpfhdr0\shpbxcolumn\shpbypara\shpwr3\shpwrk0\shpfblwtxt1\shpz0\shplid1{\sp{\sn shapeType}{\sv 20}}{\sp{\sn lineWidth}{\sv 4445}}}}\pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li1253\fi0\ri0\sb594\sa0 \f2\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Table \lang1032 12.34 \lang1033 Average Instantiation Size by Type}\par {\shp {\*\shpinst \shpleft22\shptop36\shpright6675\shpbottom36\shpfhdr0\shpbxcolumn\shpbypara\shpwr3\shpwrk0\shpfblwtxt1\shpz0\shplid1{\sp{\sn shapeType}{\sv 20}}{\sp{\sn lineWidth}{\sv 4445}}}}\pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li43\fi0\ri0\sb230\sa0\tx3784 \f2\fs20{\b0\i\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Type of Instantiation{\charscalex100\expndtw0\tab }\expndtw0 Average Size in Words}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li320\fi0\ri0\sb119\sa0\sl-238\slmult0\tqr\tx5270 \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 pointer object{\charscalex100\expndtw0\tab }\expndtw-3\lang1032 16.50 \lang1033 words}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li324\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-238\slmult0\tqr\tx5270 \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 word object{\charscalex100\expndtw0\tab }\expndtw-3\lang1032 14.53 \lang1033 words}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li317\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-238\slmult0\tqr\tx5270 \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 byte object{\charscalex100\expndtw0\tab }\expndtw-2\lang1032 6.67 \lang1033 words}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li320\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-238\slmult0\tqr\tx5270 \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 all objects{\charscalex100\expndtw0\tab }\expndtw-3\lang1032 16.38 \lang1033 words}\par {\shp {\*\shpinst \shpleft22\shptop54\shpright6675\shpbottom54\shpfhdr0\shpbxcolumn\shpbypara\shpwr3\shpwrk0\shpfblwtxt1\shpz0\shplid1{\sp{\sn shapeType}{\sv 20}}{\sp{\sn lineWidth}{\sv 4445}}}}\pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li18\fi0\ri0\sb454\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 From Table \lang1032 12.34, \lang1033 the average allocation size is less than \lang1032 17 \lang1033 words. The\line \expndtw4 memory system actually stores byte objects in words, sometimes wast-\line \expndtw2 ing an odd byte, as a relic from Xerox word-addressed memory architec-\line \expndtw7 tures. However, there are so few byte objects in the system that this\line waste is not significant. The system averages about one instantiation\line \expndtw2 for every dozen bytecodes executed. This makes for an allocation rate of\line \expndtw0\lang1032 1.4 \lang1033 words per bytecode.}\par \sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn3560\margrsxn1682\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 {\shp {\*\shpinst \shpleft7\shptop518\shprig