ache and a non-cache implementation gives}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li4\fi1660\ri0\sb72\sa0\sl-364\slmult0 \f2\fs20{\b0\i\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw15\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs18 F\sub ne\nosupersub  = fiAJS\sub nc\nosupersub    \i0 and   \i F\sub xK\nosupersub  \lang1032 = \lang1033 fiA\sub xK\nosupersub S\sub xK\nosupersub .\line \i0\expndtw3\fs22 The average cache access is given by the usual relation}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\qc\li0\fi0\ri7\sb90\sa0 \f2\fs20{\b0\i\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw9\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs18 A\sub xK\nosupersub  \i0\lang1032 = \i\lang1033 <pA\sub hit\nosupersub  \lang1032 + \lang1033 (l-<e)A\sub miss\nosupersub .}\par \sect\sectd \sbkpage\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn1594\margrsxn1422\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\tlul\tx7034 \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex134\expndtw-14\dn0\f25\cchs161\lang1032\fs16 242{\charscalex100\expndtw0\tab }}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb4\sa0 \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex134\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs16 An Assessment of Method-Lookup Caches for Smalltalk-80 Implementations}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li2232\fi0\ri0\sb317\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw5\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 The speed (bytecodes per second) depends partly on how much time is\line \expndtw-1 spent in method lookup. S\sub optimal\nosupersub  assumes the time to be zere.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li2232\fi238\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw4\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 If T\sub optimal\nosupersub  and T\sub nc\nosupersub  are the times required to execute \loch\af1\hich\af1\dbch\f25\cchs161\lang1032 \'cd\hich\af1\dbch\af25\loch\f1\cchs161  \lang1033 bytecodes at\line \expndtw-6 speeds S\sub optimal\nosupersub  and S\sub nc\nosupersub , then we have}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li4874\fi0\ri0\sb101\sa0\tx6188 \f2\fs20{\b0\i\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\loch\af1\hich\af1\dbch\f25\cchs161\lang1032\f