calex100\expndtw0\dn0\f25\cchs161\lang1032\fs18 0.4}\cell \pard\intbl\row \trowd\trgaph40 \trrh-238 \clvertalt\cltxlrtb\cellx576 \clvertalt\cltxlrtb\cellx1109 \pard \plain \cbpat0\qr\li0\fi0\ri7\sb0\sa0 \intbl \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-8\dn0\f25\cchs161\lang1032\fs20 3354}\cell \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li7\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \intbl \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f25\cchs161\lang1032\fs18 0.2}\cell \pard\intbl\row \trowd\trgaph40 \trrh-245 \clvertalt\cltxlrtb\cellx576 \clvertalt\cltxlrtb\cellx1109 \pard \plain \cbpat0\qr\li0\fi0\ri7\sb0\sa0 \intbl \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-11\dn0\f25\cchs161\lang1032\fs20 1676}\cell \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li7\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \intbl \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f25\cchs161\lang1032\fs18 0.1}\cell \pard\intbl\row \trowd\trgaph40 \trrh-187 \clvertalt\cltxlrtb\cellx576 \clvertalt\cltxlrtb\cellx1109 \pard \plain \cbpat0\qr\li0\fi0\ri7\sb0\sa0 \intbl \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f25\cchs161\lang1032\fs18 838}\cell \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li4\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \intbl \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw0\dn0\f25\cchs161\lang1032\fs18 0.1}\cell \pard\intbl\row \pard\sect\sectd \sbknone\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn1623\margrsxn1365\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 {\shp {\*\shpinst \shpleft2239\shptop101\shpright8892\shpbottom101\shpfhdr0\shpbxmargin\shpbypara\shpwr3\shpwrk0\shpfblwtxt1\shpz0\shplid1{\sp{\sn shapeType}{\sv 20}}{\sp{\sn lineWidth}{\sv 4445}}}}\pard \plain \cbpat0\qj\li2261\fi0\ri0\sb853\sa0\sl-238\slmult0 \f2\fs20{\b0\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw6\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Besides register examination, reclamation includes pointer chasing\line \expndtw2 (number of recursive refD's done), exclusive of those done to method\line contexts, plus object deallocations. Since this work is also done incre-\line \expndtw3 mentally in a non-volatilizing system it does not affect reference-count-\line \expndtw4 ing activity but it does affect reclamation latency time. To calculate the\line \expndtw16 reclamation latency we assume that the SVM executes 128K\line \expndtw4 bytecodes/second and that it takes 400ns to execute an instruction or to\line \expndtw3 locate a free object in the ZCT. The Appendix shows that it takes 2.8jas\line \expndtw2 to free an object and 2.7jus, on average, to "chase a pointer". Table \lang1032 19.4\line \expndtw3\lang1033 shows the latency period for different combinations of the experimental\line \expndtw4 variables. The latency time is always less than 41ms (the time spent\line \expndtw6 stabilizing and volatilizing the cache is insignificant compared to the\line \expndtw1 time spent reclaiming\super 29\nosupersub ), so it does not slow down the system's response\line \expndtw3 time appreciably. Table \lang1032 19.4 \lang1033 provides the information needed by an\line \expndtw4 implementor to adjust the reclamation period to suit any response time\line constraints.}\par \pard\plain\fs2\sa731\sl-1\slmult0\par\trowd\trgaph40 \trrh-346 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw15\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw15\cltxlrtb\cellx1411 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw15\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw15\cltxlrtb\cellx4521 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw15\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw15\cltxlrtb\cellx5306 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw15\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw15\cltxlrtb\cellx6674 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \intbl \f2\fs20\cell \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li115\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \intbl \f2\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw3\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Table \lang1032 19.4 \lang1033 Reclamation Latency}\cell \pard \plain \cbpat0\qr\li0\fi0\ri158\sb0\sa0 \intbl \f2\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-1\dn0\f3\cchs0\lang1033\fs20 Time}\cell \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0 \intbl \f2\fs20\cell \pard\intbl\row \trowd\trgaph40 \trrh-410 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw15\cltxlrtb\cellx1411 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw15\cltxlrtb\cellx3175 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw15\cltxlrtb\cellx4521 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs