}\par{\pard\plain \sb0\sa0\sl-1\slmult0\fs2\par}\sect\sectd \sbkpage\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn2622\margrsxn2112\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720\cols1\colsx60 \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li11\fi0\ri0\sb0\sa0\sl-259\slmult0 \f2\fs20{\b\i0\ul\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-4\dn0\f2\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Smalltalk-80: Bits of History, Words of Advice\ul0  provides insights into\line \expndtw0 the implementation of the Smalltalk-80 system \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\f24\cchs161\lang1032 \'97\hich\af0\dbch\af24\loch\f0\cchs161  \lang1033 a personal, inte-\line \expndtw1 grated, interactive programming environment. It will be of value to\line \expndtw-1 Smalltalk-80 system implementors, as well as to system program-\line mers in general.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li11\fi0\ri0\sb234\sa0\sl-259\slmult0 \f2\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-3\dn0\f2\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 This book is organized into four sections. The first section contains\line \expndtw-2 papers discussing the history of the Smalltalk-80 system, and in par-\line \expndtw1 ticular the development of the Smalltalk-80 Virtual Machine. In the\line second section the authors discuss their implementation experi-\line \expndtw-1 ences, The third section provides measurements of key parts of the\line \expndtw3 implementations The papers in the fourth section describe the\line \expndtw2 future paths that Smalltalk-80 implementors may take.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li11\fi0\ri0\sb241\sa0\sl-256\slmult0 \f2\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw2\dn0\f2\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 The authors of these papers are affiliated with five different corpo-\line \expndtw-1 rations and two universities Glenn Krasner, the editor, is a member\line \expndtw3 of the Software Concepts Group at the Xerox Palo Alto Research\line \expndtw-1 Center (PARC). This book of implementation considerations is the\line \expndtw0 second in a series of four books on the Smalltalk-80 programming\line \expndtw-4 environment.}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li11\fi0\ri0\sb158\sa0\sl-356\slmult0 \f2\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw-2\dn0\f2\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Other books in the Addison-Wesley Smalltalk-80 Series:\line \ul\expndtw0 Smalltalk-80: The Language and Its Implementation\ul0  \lang1032 (11371-6)\line \ul\expndtw-4\lang1033 Smalltalk-80: The Interactive Programming Environment\ul0  \lang1032 (11372-4)}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li18\fi0\ri0\sb54\sa0\sl-263\slmult0 \f2\fs20{\b\i0\ul\cf0\charscalex100\expndtw1\dn0\f2\cchs0\lang1033\fs22 Smalltalk-80: Creating a User Interface and Graphical Applications\line \ul0\expndtw-13\lang1032 (11370-8)}\par \pard \plain \cbpat0\ql\li0\fi0\ri0\sb3179\sa0\tx4468 \f2\fs20{\b\i0\cf0\charscalex78\expndtw-1\dn0\f2\cchs0\lang1033\fs18 ADWSON-WESIEY PUBLISHING COMPANY{\charscalex100\expndtw0\tab }\charscalex122\expndtw-5 ISBN    \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\f24\cchs161\lang1032 \'cf\hich\af0\dbch\af24\loch\f0\cchs161 -}\par \sect\sectd \sbkpage\pgwsxn15790\pghsxn23908\marglsxn1440\margrsxn1440\margtsxn1440\margbsxn360 \pard \plain \li0\ri0\sb0\sa0\pvpara\phmrg\posnegx0\posnegy0\absw0\absh21028\nowrap\dfrmtxtx10080\dfrmtxty0 {\pict\picw22771\pich37090\picwgoal12909\pichgoal21027\jpegblip
}\par{\pard\plain \sb0\sa0\sl-1\slmult0\fs2\par}\sect\sectd \sbkpage\pgwsxn11909\pghsxn16834\marglsxn173\margrsxn11736\margtsxn1440\margbsxn720 {\pard\plain \sb0\sa0\sl-1\slmult0\fs2\par}}